sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Web as Next.js Dashboard
  participant API as Medusa Routes API
  participant WF as generateRoutePlan Workflow
  participant Route as Route Planning Module
  participant Maps as Maps Provider Interface
  participant PG as PostgreSQL/PostGIS
  participant Redis as Redis Pub/Sub
  participant RN as React Native App
  Web->>API: POST /api/v1/routes/optimise
  API->>API: Validate manager permission and tenant
  API->>WF: reps, date, start points, stops
  WF->>Route: Persist optimisation request
  WF->>Maps: calculateDistanceMatrix and optimiseRoute
  Maps-->>WF: Ordered stops and totals
  WF->>Route: Create route plan, stops and assignment
  Route->>PG: Save versioned plan
  WF->>Redis: Publish route.plan.assigned
  Redis-->>RN: Push/in-app route update request
  API-->>Web: Route plan summary
